{"id":31034,"date":"2022-09-26T12:25:02","date_gmt":"2022-09-26T11:25:02","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/?p=31034"},"modified":"2023-05-17T10:55:01","modified_gmt":"2023-05-17T09:55:01","slug":"advanced-excel-training","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/advanced-excel-training\/","title":{"rendered":"Advanced Excel Training With The Excel Experts"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a programmer, you know that data is important. Being able to understand and manipulate data is a crucial skill in your knowledge arsenal. And what better way to learn how to do that than with Microsoft Excel?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">That&#8217;s why we&#8217;re excited to offer our new advanced Excel training course, taught by none other than the excel experts themselves. In this course, you&#8217;ll learn how to use Excel to its fullest potential, and you&#8217;ll be able to take your data analysis skills to the next level.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Why Take An Advanced Excel Training Course<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;re like most programmers, you&#8217;ve probably used Excel at some point in your career. But chances are, you only scratched the surface of what this powerful program is capable of. In our advanced <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-group-training\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Excel training course<\/a>, you&#8217;ll learn how to really make Excel work for you.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You&#8217;ll learn how to use complex formulas, create stunning visuals, and automate tedious tasks. Trust us &#8211; this course is worth your time!&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Advanced-Excel-Training-Course.jpg\" alt=\"Advanced Excel Training Course\" class=\"wp-image-31041\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Advanced-Excel-Training-Course.jpg 700w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/Advanced-Excel-Training-Course-300x214.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Advanced Excel Training: What You&#8217;ll Learn<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this course, you&#8217;ll learn everything from Excel basics (for those who need a refresher) to more advanced topics like VBA programming and pivot tables.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We&#8217;ve designed this course to be relevant for programmers of all levels of experience. By the end of the course, you&#8217;ll be <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/excel-group-training\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">an Excel expert!&nbsp;<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Let&#8217;s talk about what you can expect to learn.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Pivots, Tables &amp; Charts<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">One of the most important aspects of data analysis is communicating your findings effectively. In our advanced <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/microsoft-excel-training-courses\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Excel training course<\/a>, you&#8217;ll learn how to use pivot tables and charts for summarising and visualising your data quickly.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You&#8217;ll also learn how to use Excel&#8217;s built-in features to create stunning visuals that will impress your boss (or client).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Advanced Excel Formulas<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a programmer, you&#8217;re probably no stranger to formulas. But did you know that <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.microsoft.com\/en-us\/microsoft-365\/excel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Excel <\/a><\/strong>has some pretty powerful formula features? In our advanced Excel training course, you&#8217;ll learn how to use array formulas, conditional formatting, and lookup functions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You&#8217;ll also learn <strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">how to write your own custom formulas<\/span><\/strong> from scratch.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"500\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/advanced-excel-formulas.jpg\" alt=\"advanced excel formulas\" class=\"wp-image-31040 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/advanced-excel-formulas.jpg 700w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/advanced-excel-formulas-300x214.jpg 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 700px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 700\/500;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>IF, AND, OR Statements<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you want to take your <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/intermediate-excel-skills\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Excel skills<\/a> to the next level, you need to learn how to use IF, AND, and OR statements. With these powerful functions, you&#8217;ll be able to write formulas that can make decisions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You&#8217;ll also be able to <strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/automation\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">automate tasks<\/a><\/strong> like data entry and data validation.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Auditing &amp; Error Checking<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As a programmer, you know that even the slightest error can cause major problems. This is especially true when working with data.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In our advanced Excel training course, you&#8217;ll learn how to use Excel&#8217;s built-in auditing and error-checking features. You&#8217;ll also learn how to find and fix errors in your formulas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Templates &amp; Themes<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Excel is a great tool for creating custom templates and themes. In our advanced <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/microsoft-excel-tutoring\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Excel training course<\/a>, you&#8217;ll learn how to use Excel&#8217;s built-in templates and themes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You&#8217;ll also learn how to create your own custom templates and themes from scratch.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Protecting &amp; Sharing Workbooks<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">If you&#8217;re going to be working with sensitive data, you need to know how to protect your workbooks. In our advanced <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/microsoft-excel-training-courses\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Excel training course<\/a>, you&#8217;ll learn how to password-protect your workbooks.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You&#8217;ll also learn how to share your workbooks with others and how to control what they can do with them.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity is-style-wide\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Keen To Get Started? <\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Complete for form below and a member of our team will be in touch.<\/p>\n\n