i><\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"700\" height=\"500\" data-src=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/advanced-excel-training.jpg\" alt=\"advanced excel training\" class=\"wp-image-31039 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/advanced-excel-training.jpg 700w, https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/09\/advanced-excel-training-300x214.jpg 300w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 700px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 700\/500;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Conclusion<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Don&#8217;t miss out on this opportunity to learn from the excel experts and take your data analysis skills to the next level. Contact our team to learn more about our advanced <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/microsoft-excel-training-courses\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Excel training courses<\/a> today!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>FAQs<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is the best way to learn advanced Excel?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The best way to learn advanced Excel will vary depending on your level of experience and your learning style. However, we recommend taking our advanced Excel training course if you want to learn the most effective ways to use Excel <a href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/what-is-excel-data-analysis\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">for data analysis.<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What is the difference between basic and advanced Excel training?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Advanced Excel training includes pivot tables, charts, formulas, IF, AND, OR statements, auditing and error checking, templates, and themes. Basic Excel features include the ability to create and edit basic spreadsheets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How long does it take to learn advanced Excel?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Training can vary depending on skill level. However, most people who take our advanced Excel training course find that they&#8217;re able to use the features effectively within a few days.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What are some strong Excel skills?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Some strong Excel skills include the ability to use pivot tables, charts, formulas, and lookup functions. Other important skills include using IF, AND, and OR statements, as well as auditing and error checking.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>As a programmer, you know that data is important. Being able to understand and manipulate data is a crucial skill in your knowledge arsenal. And what better way to learn how to do that than with Microsoft Excel? That&#8217;s why we&#8217;re excited to offer our new advanced Excel training course, taught by none other than<a class=\"excerpt-read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/www.theexcelexperts.com\/advanced-excel-training\/\" title=\"ReadAdvanced Excel Training With The Excel Experts\">&#8230; Read more &raquo;<\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":27378,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_monsterinsights_skip_tracking":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[17],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-31034","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-excel-training"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.5 - https:\/\/yo